id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"HV7AHORTkLqIfhR-tpRmzg","review_id":"UDv9603u22OCZJVFxPgHAA","date":"2014-02-11T01:45:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9523501396179199,"text_excerpt":"Recently discovered this place while looking for delivery sushi on Yelp. Have to say, it is absolutely my favorite sushi restaurant in New Orleans. The fish is fresh, the prices are reasonable, and the delivery option is an automatic plus. Never again will I have to order from the comparatively subpar Mikimoto. I absolutely recommend \"The Tower\" appetizer. It is my favorite dish on the menu. Some negatives - the actual restaurant isn't in the most convenient location or neighborhood, and the space is a little small. The Hibachi options are passable and the anime poster decor is...interesting. Even so, I don't plan on going anywhere else for Sushi in New Orleans anymore. Closed Sundays."},{"business_id":"HV7AHORTkLqIfhR-tpRmzg","review_id":"xmUI0FElqVnwXF7aBFjeEQ","date":"2015-08-18T02:35:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9490966796875,"text_excerpt":"Getting tired of the lesser sushi options on the west bank, my friends and I decided to explore! Well, we came across Asuka and let me tell you I am so glad we did! Yes, the location looked very sketchy and parking was extremely limited. There was a big ole dip in the \"parking lot\" and yeah, parking was just bad. The outside of the restaurant makes it seem like a hole in the wall place, but don't let that scare you away. We walked inside and there was one server. It's pretty small with limited seating so I can't imagine when they get packed. We were seated quickly, being the only table at around 3 or so and got to looking at the menu. I like the variety of special rolls that they offer! B..."},{"business_id":"HV7AHORTkLqIfhR-tpRmzg","review_id":"fLoJFuqokd52m_BFS2aGLA","date":"2014-09-23T00:44:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9453551769256592,"text_excerpt":"I always have an enjoyable time here. The staff is knowledgable, friendly, and patient with foodies probing the menu. If you're in a hurry they can have a box ready for you in under 10 minutes if you order in house. Definitely a good choice for a variety of sushi lovers, the menu includes traditional rolls and Louisiana specialties including lightly and deeply fried rolls ( the Asuka roll is amazing), this place is one of my favorites in the area."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"HV7AHORTkLqIfhR-tpRmzg","photo_id":"D8KfjrZoiKl7lXk-94MsTg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/D8KfjrZoiKl7lXk-94MsTg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.915087878704071},{"business_id":"HV7AHORTkLqIfhR-tpRmzg","photo_id":"tRDx_y4H5UyliLujXexazQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/tRDx_y4H5UyliLujXexazQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.882916271686554},{"business_id":"HV7AHORTkLqIfhR-tpRmzg","photo_id":"gYDmqLTWHM5dZkBJH89Zfg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/gYDmqLTWHM5dZkBJH89Zfg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8756322860717773},{"business_id":"HV7AHORTkLqIfhR-tpRmzg","photo_id":"LRkKlzOSkq5vFI3FhBdbUQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/LRkKlzOSkq5vFI3FhBdbUQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.874455213